<h2>Company Overview: Adobe</h2>
<p>Adobe is a global leader in digital experiences, committed to changing the world by providing tools that empower artists and businesses alike to create exceptional digital content. The company offers a diverse suite of products designed to facilitate creativity, communication, and digital transformation across industries.</p>

<h3>Business Units</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Digital Media Business Unit:</strong> Focuses on tools and services that allow users to create, publish, and manage content via Adobe Creative Cloud and Document Cloud.</li>
    <li><strong>Digital Experience Business Unit:</strong> Provides solutions for businesses to manage and monetize online and offline initiatives through Adobe Experience Cloud.</li>
    <li><strong>Document Services:</strong> Specializes in revolutionizing document communication, with products like PDF, Adobe Acrobat, and Adobe Sign, which are essential for document management.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Internship Opportunity: Product Management Intern</h3>
<p>This internship involves addressing valuable customer issues by collaborating across Adobe's cloud businesses. Key responsibilities include:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Conducting research to identify user needs.</li>
    <li>Analyzing competitor landscapes and generating insights.</li>
    <li>Pitches for new product ideas.</li>
    <li>Contributing to product vision and strategy.</li>
    <li>Building requirement documents and use cases.</li>
    <li>Collaborating with Design and Engineering teams.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Candidate Requirements</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Current first-year MBA student graduating in 2026.</li>
    <li>Strong communication and interpersonal skills.</li>
    <li>Passion for technology and product management.</li>
    <li>Ability to navigate ambiguity and strong analytical skills.</li>
    <li>Technical experience is a plus.</li>
    <li>Availability for a 10-week full-time internship starting April or May 2025.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Benefits and Compensation</h3>
<p>Interns will receive:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Mentoring from experienced professionals.</li>
    <li>Creative and leadership opportunities.</li>
    <li>Wellbeing resources and professional development.</li>
    <li>A market-competitive stipend.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Company Culture</h3>
<p>Adobe nurtures an exceptional work environment that fosters growth through feedback and collaboration. The organization is recognized for its commitment to diversity and equality in the workplace.</p>

<h3>Final Notes</h3>
<p>If you are eager to make a significant impact in a supportive environment, Adobe is the ideal place for your career growth.</p>

