<html>
<head>
    <title>Adobe Company Overview</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Overview of Adobe</h2>
    <p>Adobe is a leading technology company known for transforming the world through digital experiences. It provides tools and services that empower individuals and businesses to create exceptional digital experiences. With a strong focus on innovation, Adobe is committed to fostering a culture of respect and equal opportunity within the workplace.</p>

    <h2>Business Units</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Digital Media Business Unit:</strong> Offers Adobe Creative Cloud and Document Cloud, enabling users to create, publish, and manage content.</li>
        <li><strong>Digital Experience Business Unit:</strong> Provides solutions through Adobe Experience Cloud to help businesses manage multichannel initiatives.</li>
        <li><strong>Document Services:</strong> Focuses on revolutionizing communication through documents, utilizing products like PDF, Adobe Acrobat, and Adobe Sign.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Roles Offered</h2>
    <p>Adobe is offering a <strong>Product Management Intern</strong> role that includes the following responsibilities:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Conducting primary and secondary research on user needs and trends.</li>
        <li>Analyzing the competitive landscape for insightful product pitching.</li>
        <li>Contributing to the product vision and strategy through requirement documentation.</li>
        <li>Collaborating with Design and Engineering teams for implementation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Compensation</h2>
    <p>The internship offers a <strong>market competitive stipend</strong> along with mentoring, professional development opportunities, and well-being resources.</p>

    <h2>Qualifications Required</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Current first-year MBA student graduating in 2026.</li>
        <li>Strong communication and interpersonal skills.</li>
        <li>Passion for technology, with a customer-centric focus.</li>
        <li>Available for a full-time internship for 10 weeks starting April or May 2025.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Conclusion</h2>
    <p>Adobe emphasizes a collaborative work environment where employees are encouraged to generate innovative ideas. The company is recognized globally for its exceptional workplace culture and commitment to diversity.</p>
</body>
</html>

