<h1>Company Summary: Adobe</h1>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<p><b>Adobe</b> is a global leader in digital experiences, empowering everyone from emerging artists to large enterprises with the necessary tools to create exceptional digital content. The company is dedicated to nurturing creativity and fostering innovation, underscoring its mission to transform how companies interact with customers across various digital platforms.</p>

