<h1>Company Summary: Adobe</h1>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<p><b>Adobe</b> is a leader in digital experiences, committed to empowering individuals and organizations to create exceptional digital content. With a focus on innovation, Adobe provides tools across <i>Creative Cloud</i>, <i>Document Cloud</i>, and <i>Experience Cloud</i>, enabling users to deliver beautiful and impactful experiences on various platforms.</p>

<h2>Roles Offered</h2>
<ul>
    <li><b>Product Management Intern</b></li>
</ul>
<p>As a Product Management Intern at Adobe, you will:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Conduct primary and secondary research to identify user needs and emerging trends</li>
    <li>Understand competitive landscapes and generate meaningful insights</li>
    <li>Pitch and validate new product ideas</li>
    <li>Contribute to product vision and strategy</li>
    <li>Collaborate with Design and Engineering teams</li>
</ul>

<h2>Compensation</h2>
<p>Adobe offers a market competitive stipend for interns.</p>

<h2>Key Insights from Interview Compendium</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Demonstrate strong communication and interpersonal skills.</li>
    <li>Exhibit passion for technology and a customer-centric mindset.</li>
    <li>Highlight your analytical and problem-solving skills.</li>
    <li>Be prepared to discuss prior technical experience, if applicable.</li>
    <li>Emphasize your ability to manage ambiguity and focus on user experience.</li>
</ul>

