<h1>Adobe Company Summary</h1>

<h2>Company Overview</h2>
<p><b>Adobe</b> is a leading software company specializing in digital media solutions that enable users—from emerging artists to global brands—to create and deliver exceptional digital experiences. With a mission to empower creativity, Adobe offers tools and services through its Creative Cloud and Document Cloud to enhance content creation and management across various platforms.</p>

<h2>Roles Offered</h2>
<ul>
    <li><b>Product Management Intern</b>
        <ul>
            <li>Conduct research to identify user needs and trends</li>
            <li>Analyze competitor landscape</li>
            <li>Pitch and validate new product ideas</li>
            <li>Collaborate with Design and Engineering teams</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

<h2>Compensation</h2>
<p>The internship offers a <b>market competitive stipend</b> for a full-time commitment of 10 weeks starting in April or May 2025.</p>

<h2>Key Insights from the Interview Compendium</h2>
<ul>
    <li><i>Emphasize strong communication and analytical skills during the interview.</i></li>
    <li><i>Showcase your passion for technology and customer-centric approaches.</i></li>
    <li><i>Prepare to discuss how you would handle ambiguity and problem-solving scenarios.</i></li>
    <li><i>Familiarity with product management concepts will be beneficial.</i></li>
</ul>

