<h2>Company Overview</h2>
<p><b>Adobe</b> is a global leader in digital media and digital marketing solutions. The company's mission revolves around transforming the way individuals and businesses create and deliver exceptional digital experiences through innovative technologies.</p>

<h3>Businesses</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Digital Media Business Unit:</b>
        <ul>
            <li>Focuses on tools for creating, publishing, and monetizing content via Adobe Creative Cloud and Document Cloud.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><b>Digital Experience Business Unit:</b>
        <ul>
            <li>Provides solutions to help businesses manage and measure online and offline initiatives through Adobe Experience Cloud.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><b>Document Services:</b>
        <ul>
            <li>Revolutionizing communication with documents through Adobe Acrobat, Adobe Sign, and Document Cloud solutions.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

<h3>Roles Offered</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Product Management Intern</b>
        <ul>
            <li>Conduct research to identify user needs and trends.</li>
            <li>Pitch and validate new product ideas.</li>
            <li>Collaborate with Design and Engineering teams on implementation.</li>
            <li>Build requirement documents and outline user journeys.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

<h3>Compensation</h3>
<p>The internship offers a <b>market competitive stipend</b>.</p>

<h3>Key Insights from Interview Compendium</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Successful candidates are often those who can <b>demonstrate strong communication</b> and <b>interpersonal skills</b>.</li>
    <li>Having a <i>passion for technology</i> and an <i>aptitude for product management</i> is critical.</li>
    <li>Interviewers value <b>analytical skills</b> and <b>customer-centricity</b>.</li>
    <li>Experience in <i>technical roles</i> can be an added advantage.</li>
</ul>

<p>Explore more about Adobe from the <a href="https://blog.adobe.com">Adobe Life blog</a> and learn about their commitment to employee growth and diversity.</p>

